                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaweka askari wenye kulinda ngome katika Edomu; katikati ya Edomu yote akaweka ngome, na Waedomi wote wakawa watumwa wa Daudi. Naye BWANA akampa Daudi kushinda kila alikokwenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
